      "lines": [
        "**37** 定理. **圆周的切线垂直于这个圆周过切点的半径.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "已知: $p$是圆周$(O,r)$上过点$A$的切线."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "求证: $p\\perp(OA)$(图189)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "证明. 根据已知条件，直",
        "线$p$上所有的点，除了点$A$以",
        "外，都在圆周的外面. 因此，当",
        "这条直线上的$B$点不同于$A$点",
        "时，有$|OB|>|OA|$. 就是说，",
        "$|OA|$是从点$O$到直线$p$上所"
      ]
    },
    {
